<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">WAG- Kami Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Usenga Unogile kama vuwandikigwe na Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wag</para>
  <para style="mt2">Usenga Unogile kama vuwandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Wagalatia chandikigwa na Msenga wa Mulungu Paulo 1:1. Ikala balua ija Paulo iyandike kwa mabumbila ga wamtogole Kilisito ga Wagalatia na yodahika ikala mmilao ya 48 mbaka 57 kulawa viyavumbuke Kilisito. Wagalatia wao ni wanhu wokala mmajimbo ga Waloma weli Galatia. Weli na ilimu hawavimanyile goya kua chipindi Paulo yokwandika balua ino kakalahi, mbali kae ya Efeso na Kolinto izo kae mbili zodahika uko yakalile. Paulo kawandikila wamtogole Kilisito, banzi zose mbili Wayahudi na waja haweli Wayahudi, mmabumbila ga wamtogole Kilisito weli Galatia. Paulo kandika hasa kwambuli ya kubela ufundaji wa uvwizi uja ulonga kua wamtogole Kilisito wolondeka kuwinza mahala ga Wayahudi kulawa Lagano da Umwaka, hasa kwambuli ya kwingila kumbi. Hana chibumbila cha wanhu mgati mwa wamtogole Kilisito kulawa Yuda woswangiza wamtogole Kilisito waja haweli Wayahudi wengile kumbi. Ivija wamkema Paulo kotumila udaho wa ki usenga wa Mulungu wingila mmauzo. Paulo kaugombela usenga wake wa Mulungu kwa kuwalongela gaja gamlawilile 1:11-2-14 na kaugombela Usenga Unogile kwa kufambula kua ulohozi wopatika kwa kumtogola Yesu Kilisito yaiyeka 2:16. Malawilo ga unovu uja Mulungu kowalagusila wanhu na sio gowasang'hana wanhu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Galiumo</para>
  <para style="io">1. Paulo kasonga balua yake kwa kuwalamusa mabumbila ga wamtogole Kilisito gali uko Galatia. Muisula 1:1-5.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Amala Paulo kawafambulila vija viyakalile umwaka kuigombela kwa ufundaji wake wa kweli na kulagusa kua kageza kukala kwa kulongozigwa na ndagizi mbali iyo haigendile goya. Muisula 1:6-2-21.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Labaho Paulo kengila mgati ng'hani kufambula ndagizi viilonda na unovu wa Mulungu uli muulohozi. Muisula 3-4.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Amala Paulo kolava malagizo kwa wamtogole Kilisito wanogile viwalondeka kukala Muisula 5:6-10.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Paulo kakomeleza balua yake kwa kuwalaga na kuwapula seke waisemwe kua Mulungu yahakutenda umuhindukile kua munhu wa sambi icho chinhu goya ng'hani cha kukulongoza kulawa mgati, kubila kwingila kumbi. Muisula 6:11-18.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Niye Paulo nili msenga wa Mulungu, situmigwe kwa ludabwa lwa munhu mbali kwa udaho wa Yesu Kilisito na wa Mulungu Tata yamzilibule Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Niye hamwe na wamtogole Kilisito wose weli hamwe na niye chogalamusa mabumbila ga wamtogole Kilisito ga uko Galatia. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Nowapulila unovu wa Mulungu ukale na mweye na utindiwala kulawa kwa Mulungu Tata yetu na kulawa kwa Mndewa Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Kilisito kailava mwenyego kwambuli ya kusegeza malozo getu kuilinga na wende wa Mulungu wetu na Tata, ili yadahe kuchilohola muuisi ino ya sambi ya ubananzi. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Kumwake iyo ukale ukulu wa Mulungu mazua gose galibule uhelelo! Pepa.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga Unogile umwe tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Nikanganya ng'hani mchipindi chiguhi tu chibitile, na mweye momlema Mulungu ija yawakemile kwa unovu wa Kilisito, na mouwinza usenga wa namna imwenga uwoneka kama Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Mbali habule Usenga Unogile umwenga. Viilongeka ni kua hana wanhu wowazaganyeni, waja wanhu wolonda kuubananga Usenga wa Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Mbali, hata yahawa munhu imwe mmwetu hebu mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kulawa Kuulanga, kowaligulileni usenga hauwilinga na uja chiwaligulileni, baho munhu iyo yenukiligwe na Mulungu! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Chimala kuwalongeleni, na vino sambi nolonga kaidi. Kama munhu yoyose yahawaligulileni usenga wa namna imwenga, hauwilinga na uja mmalile kuubokela, iyo munhu yenukiligwe! <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Sambi nolonda kutogoligwa na wanhu? Hebu na Mulungu? Hebu ivo, nolonda kuweng'ha deng'o wanhu? Kama nihatendile ivo, niye nihalekile kua mtumigwa wa Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo viyapatile kua msenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Mbwiga zangu nolonda mvimanye kua uja usenga niuligule haulawa kwa wanhu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Niye siubokele kulawa kwa munhu, wala sifundigwe na munhu. Yesu Kilisito mwenyego iyo yanifunulile.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Habule mbuli kua mmala kuvimanya vija vinikalile nokala umwaka kwa kuiwinza mazoela ga Kiyahudi. Movimanya vinididununze bumbila da wanhu wamtogole Kilisito kubita chipimo na vinilondile kuwabananga kabisa kutogola kwao. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Enaa, niye niwahuma wayangu wengi waja wa mkamo wangu kwa kugombela mazoela ga Kiyahudi. Niiyoha ng'hani kugabokela mahala ga wavele wetu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Mbali Mulungu kwa unovu wake, kakala yanisagule hata ning'hali sinavumbuka, kanikema nimsang'hanile. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Kalonda kunifunulila Mwanage nimmanye vija viyali ili niligule Usenga Unogile kwa wanhu hawali Wayahudi. Nie simuuzile munhu yoyose, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />na bila kukwela tanhu kuita Yelusalemu kwa waja wanilongolele kua wasenga, mosi niita isi ya Alabia na amala nibwela kaidi Damasiko. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Ikala tu viibitile milao midatu, baho niitile Yelusalemu kuiona na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ulonzi wa Chiyunani wolonga Kefa. Kefa ni zina dimwenga da Petulo</char></note>Petulo. Nikala uko kwa mazua kumi na tano, <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />mbali siwaonile wasenga wamwenga, ila Yakobo mdodo wake Mndewa Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Gano ganimwandikileni, Mulungu kovimanya, niye sivwiza!<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Hamwande niita muiisi ya Silia na Kilikia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Chipindi icho, niye mwenyego nikala simanyike kwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisito wa kuja Yudea. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Chiwakalile wochimanya ni chija tu wachihulike. “Munhu ija yakalile yochidununza umwaka, sambi koligula mbuli za kumtogola Mulungu ukuja kuyakalile yogeza kukubananga!” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Baho, wamwing'ha nhogolwa Mulungu kwambuli yangu.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Wasenga wamwenga womtogola Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Viibitile milao kumi na mine, niita kaidi Yelusalemu hamwe na Balinaba, na ivija nimsola Tito hamwe na cheye. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Niita uko kwavija Mulungu kakala kanifunulila niite uko. Mchigwena, niwalongela vilongozi wao mbuli ya Usenga Unogile uniuligule kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi. Nhenda ivo giladi ili sang'hano yangu inisang'hane na ija inisang'hana sambi, sekeyage bule. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Waitogolela na nie hata miangu Tito ija mgiliki, hawamswangize yengile kumbi, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />hata yahawa kukala na mbwiga wamwenga wa uvwizi walondile yengile kumbi. Wanhu wano wengila kwa ubala na kulolesa vichikala goya kwa kuilinga na Kilisito Yesu, ili wachitende watumwa wa ndagizi za Musa, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />mbali hachiitogolele nao hata chidodo ili ija kweli ya Usenga Unogile ukale na mweye mazua gose.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Vilongozi wao watogoligwa ng'hani hawakalile na mbuli imwenga yakunilongela. Enaa, watogoligwa ng'hani mbali kumwangu iyo si chinhu, kwavija Mulungu hamuonela munhu. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Badili yake, wavimanya kua Mulungu kakala yanhumile kuligula Usenga Unogile kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga kama vija Petulo viyakalile katumigwa kuligula kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Mulungu ija yamdahize Petulo kua msenga kwa Wayahudi, ivija iyo yanidahize na niye kua msenga kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Baho, Yakobo na Petulo na Yohana waja wooneka kua vilongozi wakulu, wavimanya kua Mulungu kakala yaning'ile unovu uwo na wachamha makono, yani Balinabasi na niye ili iwe chilaguso cha wanhu chiilumbile. Cheye chilitogolela chikasang'hane sang'hano kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi, na wao wasang'hane kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Wachipula chinhu chimwe, sekechiwasemwe vikumbi muyega, iyo mbuli nikalile noiyoha kuitenda.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo komzuma Petulo uko Antiokio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Petulo viyavikile kae ya Antiokia simtogolele hazelu kwa vija kakala yabanange. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Wanhu waja wakalile walagizigwe na Petulo viwakalile wang'hali hawanavika, Petulo kakala yoja ndia hamwe na wanhu haweli Wayahudi. Mbali viwavikile wanhu wao, kaleka kuja hamwe na wanhu haweli Wayahudi, kwa kudumba chibumbila cha waja wowaswangiza wengile kumbi. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Hata Wayahudi wamwenga wamtogole Kilisito wailumba nayo Petulo muisang'hano ino ya ubilikizi, nawo wamtogola Balinaba viyalongile kwa mbuli ya ubilikizi wao. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Baho, vinionile kua wakala wolongelela mbuli ya Usenga Unogile vihile, nimlongela Petulo baho ha wanhu wose, “Gweye ni Myahudi mbali kokala kama wanhu haweli Wayahudi na si kama Myahudi. Ivo, kodahaze kuwashwangiza wanhu haweli Wayahudi kukala kama Wayahudi?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi na wanhu haweli Wayahudi woloholigwa kwa kutogola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Kweli, kulawa mwaka cheye chileligwa Wayahudi na sio wanhu wokemigwa, “Wanhu haweli Wayahudi weli na malozo.” <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Mbali chovimanya kweli kua munhu hodahika kua mtogoligwa kwambuli ya kuzitegeleza ndagizi, ila tu kwa kumtogola Yesu Kilisito. Cheye Wayahudi ivija chimtogola Yesu Kilisito ili chipate kutendigwa watogoligwa kwanzila ya kumtogola Kilisito, habule munhu hata imwe yotendigwa mtogoligwa ha Mulungu kwa kutegeleza ndagizi. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Yahawa cholonda kutendigwa kua watogoligwa na Mulungu kwa kuilumba na Kilisito, kuno cheye chooneka kua china malozo kama wanhu haweli Wayahudi, ivo, mbuli ino yooneka kua Kilisito kochitaza vichisang'hana malozo? Hambee hata chidodo! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Yahawa nihaleka kuwinza ndagizi ili mhate kutogoligwa na Mulungu, amala kaidi nisonga kuwinza ndagizi za Musa, baho niye nokua mtenda malozo. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Kwavija, kwa mbuli ya iyo ndagizi, niye nidanganika, ndagizi yenyego ing'oma, mhate kukala kwa mbuli ya Mulungu. Niye nikomigwa hamwe na Kilisito mumsalaba, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />na sambi nina ugima, mbali si niye kaidi, ila Kilisito kokala mgati yangu. Ugima uno nili nao sambi ni kwa mbuli ya kutogola, kutogola kwa nzila ya Mwana wa Mulungu yaning'ile wende hata kaulava ugima wake kwambuli yangu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Niye siulema unovu wa Mulungu. Kama hana munhu kotendigwa mtogoligwa kwambuli ya ndagizi, baho Kilisito kadanganika bule!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Kutogola hebu ndagizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Mweye Wagalatia waja dimema ena, da hindi ena! Ivo, yalihi yawalogile? Mbuli ya kuwambigwa Yesu Kilisito mumsalaba ikala ilongigwe hazelu ha meso genu. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Chinilonda ni kuchimanya chinhu chimwe kulawa kumwenu. Ivo, mubokela Muhe wa Mulungu kwambuli kama viilondeka na ndagizi hebu kwa mbuli ya kuhulika na kuutogola Usenga Unogile? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Ivo, kumbe mweye ni dimema ena, dahindi ena kubitiliza? Mweye mkala msongile kubokela Usonga Unogile kwa kutazigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu, ivo, sambi molonda kukomeleza kwa ludabwa lwenu wenyego? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Ivo, zija mbuli zose ziwapatile mweye zaga bule tu? Hambee havidahika! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Eti, Mulungu yomwing'hani Muhe wake na kuwasang'hanila miujiza mmwenu kwa vija mozitenda zilondeka na ndagizi, hebu kwa vija mouhulika Usenga Unogile na kuutogola? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Tebu, loleni mbuli ya Ibulahimu, kama Mayandiko vigandikigwe, “Ibulahimu kamtogola Mulungu na kwa kutogola kwake, Mulungu kamtogola kua mtogoligwa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Kwaivo baho, mvimanye kua wanhu womtogola Mulungu wao weli ulelo wakweli wa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Mayandiko ga Mulungu galagusa kua Mulungu yang'hali kowasang'hanila wanhu haweli Wayahudi kua watogoligwa kwa nzila ya kutogola. Kwaivo, Mayandiko ga Mulungu galongola kumligulila Ibulamu Usenga Unogile, “Kubitila gweye isi zose zobokela ganogile ga Mulungu.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Baho, Ibulamu katogola na kabokela ganogile ga Mulungu, na waja wose wakalile wotogola wabokela ganogile ga Mulungu ivija.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Mbali waja wose wotumanila kusang'hana viilonda ndagizi, wenukiligwa. Kwavija Mayandiko ga Mulungu gandikigwa, “Munhu yoyose ija hazigoga na kuzitenda mbuli zose zandikigwe mchitabu cha ndagizi, kenukiligwa na Mulungu!” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Ni kweli kua kwa kuwinza ndagizi hakudaha kumtenda munhu kua mtogoligwa, kwavija Mayandiko gandika, “Munhu yatogoligwa kokala kwa kulongozigwa na kutogola kwake.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Mbali ndagizi haitumanila kutogola, ila Mayandiko gandika, “Munhu yotenda viilonda ndagizi kosang'hana vija viilonda ndagizi.” <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kilisito kachikombola kulawa muinyinukila ya ndagizi za Musa kwa kuchisolela nyinukila iyo kwa mbuli yetu, kwavija Mayandiko gandika, “Yoyose yawambigwe mumsalaba kenukiligwa na Mulungu.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Mbuli ino itendeka giladi ili gaja ganogile ga Mulungu yeng'higwe Abulahamu gawavikile wanhu haweli Wayahudi kubitila Kilisito, na ili kwa kutogola, chiubokele uja Muhe uja Mulungu yachilalike.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndagizi na kuitogolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Mbwiga zangu, nomwing'hani mfano kulawa muugima wetu wachila zua. Tebu tongeni kwa mbuli ya malagano ga wanhu waidi waitogolele mbaka kusainigwa na waidi wao waugela muhuli, baho habule munhu yonda yaubene hebu kongeza chinhu chochose. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Baho, Mulungu kamlalika Abulahamu na ulelo wake. Mayandiko hagalonga kwa mbuli ya wengi, “Na ulelo wake,” yani wengi, ila gandika, “Na mlelo wake,” yani imwe, nayo iyo Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Chinilonda kulonga icho chino. Mulungu katenda lagano jake na kadigangamiza, ndagizi za Musa zija zilawilile milao mia nne na salasini hamwande zikala zing'hali kulawilila. Hazidahile kudibena ijo lagano wala kudihindula ijo laliko. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Kwavija, kama gweko da Mulungu dopatika kwa kutegeleza ndagizi, baho haidaha kaidi kutumanila laliko da Mulungu. Mulungu kamwing'ha ganogile gake Abulahimu kwavija kakala yamlalike. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Ivo baho ndagizi ya choni? Yongezigwa baho ili kulagusa ubananzi wa wanhu, mbaka vonda yeze ija mlelo wa Abulamu ija yeng'higwe dija laliko. Mulungu kamwing'ha Musa ndagizi kubitila mtumigwa wake wa kwa Mulungu nayo Musa kaweng'ha wanhu. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Hebu iyo msenga halondigwa kama yahawa mbuli yenyego yokua ya munhu imwe, mbali Mulungu ni imwe ija yekile laliko na Ibulahimu bila msenga.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vija ndagizi viilonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Ivo, ndagizi yoibishila na laliko da Mulungu? Hambe! Kama ndagizi ilavigwe ihadahile kuweng'ha wanhu ugima, baho chihatogoligwe na Mulungu kwa kutegeleza ndagizi. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Mayandiko ga Mulungu gakomeleza kulonga kua, isi yose ya yolongozigwa na udaho wa malozo, ivo baho, waja wose womtogola Yesu Kilisito wokwing'higwa chija chiyalalongile Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Vichikalile ching'hali hachinamtogola Kilisito, ndagizi ichitenda kua wafungigwa, kuno chobetela kutogola uko kufunhuligwe.<verse eid="GAL 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Baho, iyo ndagizi ikala kama yaya wetu mbaka viyezile Kilisito ili kubitila kutogola chitendigwe watogoligwa kwa kumtogola Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Sambi kumtogola Kilisito kuvika, kwaivo ndagizi haidaha kua yaya kaidi kumwetu.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Kwa kumtogola Kilisito mweye mose muwa wana wa Mulungu kwa nzila ya kuilumba na Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Mweye mose mbatizigwe muilumba na Kilisito, ivo ni kama vija mumvala Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Baho habule kaidi kuleka kuilinga kwa Myahudi na munhu heli Myahudi, mtumwa na munhu heli mtumwa, mulume na mwanachike, wose ni chinhu chimwe kwa kuilumba na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Mweye mwa wanhu wa Kilisito, baho mweye wa ulelelo wa Abulahamu, na mobokela gaja Mulungu gayalalike.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Baho, chinilonda kulonga ni kua, muhazi yahawa yang'hali mwana mdodo, iyo koilinga na mtumwa, hata ihawa uzenzi wose uwo wake. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Chipindi chose icho kokala muulezi wa walolezi na waja womwimila mbaka chipindi chija chikikwe na tatake. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Cheye ivija chikala kama wana wadodo, chikala cholongozigwa kwa mahala gaja golongoza muiisi. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Chipindi chija chilondeke vichivikile, Mulungu kamlagiza Mwanage muiisi ino. Mwanage iyo yaleligwe na mwanachike, kakala yagogigwe na ndagizi za Wayahudi, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />yapate kuwakombola waja wagogigwe na ndagizi ili cheye Wayahudi chitendigwe wana wa Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Sambi, kwavija mweye ni wanage, Mulungu kamlagiza Muhe wa Mwanage mmioyo yenu, Muhe ija yochitenda chimkeme Mulungu “Aba,” iyo kulonga “Tata yetu.”<verse eid="GAL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Baho gweye si mtumwa kaidi, ila mwana. Na yahawa ni mwana, baho gweye kobokela gose kulawa kwa Mulungu gaja gayawekile wanage.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kengila kitwetwetwe kwambuli ya Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Baho umwaka hamummanyile Mulungu na ivo muisang'hanila milungu ija haikalile Mulungu wa kweli. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Vino sambi kwa vija mommanya Mulungu wa kweli na momanyika nayo, ivo modahaze kubwelela kaidi kugasang'hanila mahala ga umwaka? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Mng'hali mosang'hana mbuli za kuvina sona za misimo ya mazua na miezi na milao!<verse eid="GAL 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ningila kitwetwetwe kua sang'hano niisang'hane kwa mbuli yenu yagabule!<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Mbwiga zangu, nompulani mukale kama niye, seke mlongozigwe na nda ndagizi, kama nie vinikalile kumwenu. Vinizile kumwenu hamnhendele chinhu chochose chihile. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Movimanya kua utamu wangu uwo unitendile niye nikale kumwenu, kuwaligulileni Usenga Unogile kwa mala ya mosi.<verse eid="GAL 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Hata ivo, chipindi chija hamna nizeleu hebu kunilema kwambuli ya uzidilwa wangu hata kama mshwangizigwa kutenda ivo, mbali mnibokela kama watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu, mnibokela niye kama vija Kilisito Yesu mwenyego.<verse eid="GAL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Mkala muindeng'helo, sambi choni chilawilile? Noilahila kua kulawa chija chipindi, mwahadahile hata kugang'ola meso genu na kuning'ha niye. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Ivo, vino sambi niwa mhasanyi wenu kwavija viniwalongeleni ija kweli?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Wanhu wao wamwenga wogazika kwambuli yenu, mbali viwogesa kwa mbuli ya mweye havinogile. Wolonda sekemuilumbe na niye ili mweye muwahunganikile wao.<verse eid="GAL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Kweli ni mbuli inogile mazua gose, kuwahunganikila wamwenga mzimbuli zinogile, na sio tu chipindi niye nili na mweye. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Mweye wanangu wa wende! Kolonga vija mwanachike yeli na inda viyogaya chipindi chija cha kulela, na niye nogendelela kugaya kwa mbuli yenu mbaka haja wanhu vonda waone vumsang'hana kama Kilisito viyalonda. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Maza nahawile hamwe na mweye vino sambi, baho nahapatile kuwamanya goya vumli na kudimanya da kulonga. Sambi ningila kitwetwetwe kwa mbuli yenu!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa Hajili na Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Tebu nomuuzani, mweye molonda kulongozigwa na ndagizi. Ivo, muuhulika vija ndagizi viilonga? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Mmayandiko ga Mulungu gandikigwa kua, Abulahamu kakala na wana waidi, imwe kulawa kwa mwanachike mtumwa na imwenga kwa mwanachike heli mtumwa. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Ija mwanachike mtumwa kalela kulinga vija viilondeka, mbali ija mwanachike heli mtumwa kalela kwa mbuli ya laliko da Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Mbuli izo ziwa mfano, kwavija wao waidi ni mfano wa malagano maidi, da mosi ijo dija disang'hanigwe kulugongo Sinai, na msenga wake ni Hajili, na wana wake woleligwa muutumwa. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Hajili iyo mfano wa lugongo lwa sinai uli uko Alabia, na mfano wa kae ya Yelusalemu ya sambi, kwavija kae ino ya muutumwa hamwe na wanhu wake.<verse eid="GAL 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Mbali Yelusalemu ili Kuulanga kwa Mulungu kolonga vija mwanachike ija heli muutumwa, nayo iyo mfano wa mama yetu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Kwavija yandikigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">“Deng'ha gweye ulibule ulelo ija hulelile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Toa dizi gweye hupatile usungu kuibasula!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Kwavija wana wa ija yasigwe ni wengi kubita wa ija yeli na mulume.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Ivo, baho mweye mbwiga zangu, mweye ni wana wa Mulungu kuilinga na laliko jake kama viyawile Isaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Kama vija mazua gaja mwana viyaleligwe chiunhu kamdununza ija mwana yaleligwe kwa udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu, na iyo yogendelela mbaka sambi. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Mayandiko ga Mulungu golongaze? Golonga, “Muwinge mama yeli mtumwa hamwe na mwanage, kwavija mwana wa mtumwa kokua muubananzi hamwe na mwana wa mama heli mtumwa.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Baho ndugu, cheye si wana wa mtumwa ila wa ija mama heli mtumwa.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Mkale bila utumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kilisito kachitenda chikale bila utumwa na kalonda chikale ivo. Baho mgangamale na wala seke mtogole kubwela kaidi kukala kama watumwa wa ndagizi.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Tegelezeni! Niye iyo Paulo nolonga na mweye! Kama mwahatogola kwingila kumbi kwambuli ya kutegeleza ndagizi za Musa, baho Kilisito honda yawatende chochose. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Nolonga hazelu kaidi. Chila yotogola kwingila kumbi kolondeka yaitegeleze ndagizi yose. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Kama mololela kua wana watogoligwa na Mulungu kweli kwa nzila ya kutegeleza ndagizi, baho muinega kutali na Kilisito, na mwa kutali na unovu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Kwa ubanzi wetu, cheye chobeta kwa tamanilo kwa udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu ili chitendigwe kua watogoligwa kwa nzila ya kumtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Baho, chihawa chiilumba na Kilisito Yesu, kwingila kumbi hebu kuleka kwingila kumbi si chinhu, chinogile ni kusang'hana kwa wende uko kolagusa kumtogola Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Mkala mogenda goya, yalihi yawagomile kugendelela goya? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Yasang'hane ivo sio ija Mulungu yawakemile. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Ufundaji uno wa uvvwizi ni kama hamila chidodo tu yosasula bulunge jose da usage. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Kwa mbuli ya kuilumba kwetu na Mndewa, nina tumanilo kulu kua mweye hamleka kuilinga na nie vija vinili. Kaidi yoyose ija yowatenda mgombe yawe ino hebu ija kokwinukiligwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Mbwiga zangu ning'hali noligula kua yolondeka wanhu kwingila kumbi, habali baho wang'hali wogendelela kunidununza? Maza yahawile ivo, kuligula kwangu kwambuli ya ifa ya Yesu mumsalaba uhalekile kuwagevuza Wayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Vinilondile niye vino, wao wowatenda mweye mgombe kwambuli ya kwingila kumbi, maza wahaikomile ulume wenyego!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Mweye mbwiga, mkemigwa ili mkale bila utumwa. Mbali utumwa uwo seke uwe chanduso cha kumema maya za muiisi, ila molondeka muisang'hanile kwa wende.<verse eid="GAL 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Ndagizi za Musa zose zenela kwa kuigoga ndagizi ino imwe. “Mwing'he wende miago kama vuuing'ha wende mwenyego.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Mwahagomba na kuipalula na kuiluma kama wanyama, itiganyeni seke muikome wenyego kwa wenyego.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Baho nolonga vino, mgende kwa kulongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu, na mweye hamuwinza kaidi maya za lukuli. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Maya za lukuli haziitogolela na vuulonda Muhe wa Mulungu, na vuulonda Muhe wa Mulungu haziilumba na maya za lukuli. Mbuli izo mbili haziitogolela, na kwa mbuli iyo mweye hamdaha kusang'hana gaja mgalonda mweye wenyego. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ihawa molongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu habule kaidi kulongozigwa na ndagizi.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Baho sang'hano za lukuli zomanyika vino. Ugoni na uluhadu na kuhondomola, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kufugamila milungu ya nyang'iti na uhawi na uhasanyi na kuitoa na maya na ludoko na ugila na kuibishila na kuihasanya, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />migongo na kukoligwa na umelo na mbuli zimwenga zilinga izo. Nomzumani kaidi kama vinimalile kulonga, wanhu wotenda mbuli zilinga izo honda wengile muufaume wa Mulungu ng'o.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Mbali manhunda ga kulongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu ni wende na deng'o na utindiwala na kufunya moyo na unovu wa Mulungu na nying'ha na utogoligwa, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />uhole na kuikimila mwenyego. Baho habule ndagizi yonda kuzilema mbuli izo. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Waja weli na Kilisito waziwamba muumsalaba mbuli zao wenyego za muiisi hamwe na kutonga kwao kwihile na maya zake. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Chahakala kwa kutazigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu ivo chimleke yachilongoze viyolonda. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Baho, sekechiikunge na sekechiwe na ndwagi hebu kuionela migongo.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Chiifunyile moyo na kuitaza wenyego</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Mweye mbwiga zangu, kama mwahamuona munhu imwenga katenda gehile, baho mweye mlongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu mzumeni munhu iyo ili yawe munhu goya, mbali tendeni ivo kwa uhole kuno mkale kwa kuitiganya wenyego ili na mweye sekemgezigwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Itazeni kuisolela mbuli zenu wenyego kwa wenyego, kwabuli iyo mokua moisang'hanila goya ndagizi ya Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Munhu yahaiona kua chinhu na kumbe si chinhu, iyo koivwizila mwenyego.<verse eid="GAL 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Chila munhu na yailolese mwenyego viyotenda. Yahawa katenda goya, baho kodaha kuiona katenda goya kwa chija chiyatendile bila kuilinga na munhu imwenga. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Baho chila munhu kolamuligwa kwa chija chiyasang'hane. <verse eid="GAL 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Ija yafundigwe usenga wa Mulungu na yamlongele mbuli zinogile iyo mfundaji wake mbuli zinogile ziyeli nazo.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Sekemuivwizile, Mulungu hazehigwa. Chiyahandile munhu icho chiyagobola. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Iyo yohanda muimaya ya isi, nayo kogobola umo ubananzi, mbali yohanda muu Muhe wa Mulungu, kogobola ugima ulibule uhelelo kulawa kwa Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Baho sekechilegele kusang'hana ganogile, kwavija kama hachilegela chokwiza kugobola muisimo wake. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Kwaivo, chihawa ching'hali na chipindi, baho chiwasang'hanile ganogile wanhu wose, chinogile ng'hani kwa mbwiga wamtogole Kilisito wayetu.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa chikomelezo na kulaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Loleni vija viniwandikile kwa helufi ng'hulu ng'hulu kwa mkono wangu mwenyego. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Waja wolonda kuoneka wanoga kwambuli za lukuli, iyo wolonda kuwashwangiza mweye mwingile kumbi. Wosang'hana ivo tu kwavija wolonda seke wadununzigwe kwa mbuli ya msalaba wa Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Kwavija wao wenyego wengila kumbi mbali hawazigoga ndagizi, mbali wowalondeni mweye mwingile kumbi ili wao waigodele kwa mbuli ija iwawatendele mzing'huli zenu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Mbali niye siigodela chochose ila tu ifa ya Yesu mumsalaba, kulawa muiifa yake mbuli zose za muiisi ino hazifaya chinhu kumwangu. Ugima wangu wa mwaka uwambigwa hamwe nayo mumsalaba. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Kwingila kumbi hebu kuleka kwingila kumbi si chinhu, chinogile ni kua chilumbe cha sambi.<verse eid="GAL 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Wanhu woiwinza nzila iyo, wakale na utindiwala na bazi, utindiwala na bazi ijo kwa Izilaeli, wanhu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Sambi, munhu yoyose sekeyanigaze kaidi, kwavija ng'ovu zinili nazo ni kwambuli ya kumsang'hanila Mndewa Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Mbwiga zangu, unovu wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito ukale na mweye. Pepa.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>